WEBVTT

00:02.000 --> 00:02.760
Father

00:02.840 --> 00:04.360
Your son's words come from the heart

00:04.440 --> 00:05.840
Please reconsider, Father

00:10.440 --> 00:11.200
Prince of Jin

00:11.320 --> 00:12.720
Please

00:29.400 --> 00:30.960
General, have compassion for me

00:31.040 --> 00:31.960
And also have compassion for

00:32.040 --> 00:33.707
The people in the south

00:33.960 --> 00:35.160
The matter of going north

00:35.320 --> 00:36.760
We will definitely fight

00:37.200 --> 00:39.533
But how about waiting a bit longer?

00:40.480 --> 00:41.840
Virtuous and wise

00:42.160 --> 00:43.600
None surpass Your Majesty

00:46.500 --> 00:58.500
The storm of the banquet temporarily subsided, but Prince Ning and the Chen family continued to escalate their suppression of you. Under the counsel of Xie Jian'an, you had no choice but to submit another memorial requesting a Northern Expedition.

01:03.400 --> 01:05.720
Since you so want to go north

01:05.800 --> 01:07.880
I'll let you lead troops to fight

01:07.960 --> 01:09.200
If you don't win

01:09.280 --> 01:11.280
Don't come back to see me

01:12.160 --> 01:13.360
Your son

01:13.440 --> 01:14.840
Accepts the order

01:19.800 --> 01:21.720
In the nineteenth year of Yuankang

01:21.800 --> 01:24.280
Prince of Jin Sikong Yao led troops north

01:24.360 --> 01:26.760
Accidentally fell into heavy encirclement

01:28.800 --> 01:30.000
Men of Xuan Kingdom

01:30.080 --> 01:31.600
Do not accept the shame of capture

01:31.680 --> 01:32.680
Gentlemen

01:32.760 --> 01:34.280
Follow me in bloody battle

01:34.360 --> 01:35.760
Until death

01:37.280 --> 01:39.400
You fought the enemy until dusk

01:39.760 --> 01:41.800
In the end, you were outnumbered

01:41.880 --> 01:43.547
And died on the battlefield

01:43.920 --> 01:45.720
Emperor Xuan Sikong Jing heard the news

01:45.880 --> 01:47.040
Grieved deeply

01:47.160 --> 01:48.827
Could not eat or drink

01:48.960 --> 01:49.800
Not long after

01:49.920 --> 01:52.680
Made Sikong Zheng the crown prince
